  "description": "The army of the Soviet Union during World War II. The Soviet forces liberated Auschwitz in January 1945. The text overlay misattributes the liberation to 'the ussr' (which is factually correct) but frames it in a misleading or trivializing way, which is part of the meme's hateful intent. This historical fact is necessary to understand the inaccuracy and potential insensitivity of the text.",
